# Short landscape (844 × 390): New Game, a bid by click, then the first trick by keys.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Press New Game
frames 20
touch =New Game
until 120 Your bid
frames 10
save land-bid
touch =Pass (0)
until 600 Your turn
frames 20
save land-play
touch 53.6% 58%
until 200 12 cards
frames 20
save land-trick
